              "category": "grammar",
              "presentation": "core",
              "title": "命令式結合代名詞：Dimmi",
              "sourceCueIds": [
                "c2"
              ],
              "contextCueIds": [],
              "explanation": "Dimmi 是動詞 dire（說）的第二人稱單數命令式 di' 加上間接受詞代名詞 mi（對我）合併而成的形式。當單音節命令式 di' 連接代名詞時，代名詞字首輔音通常雙寫（如接 mi 形成 -mmi；但接 gli 或其組合時不雙寫，如 digli）。在此處表示「告訴我」。",
              "sourceSpans": [
                {
                  "cueId": "c2",
                  "start": 1,
                  "end": 6
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "eedfb42a-614e-4bd8-9864-08eeba24cbb9:s0:p2",
              "utteranceIds": [
                "48ed4b6b-becc-4b01-86b1-ec561b87b646"
              ],
              "category": "chunks",
              "presentation": "core",
              "title": "話題轉換表達：A proposito",
              "sourceCueIds": [
                "c2"
              ],
              "contextCueIds": [],
              "explanation": "A proposito 意為「順便一提」或「對了」，在義大利語日常會話中常用於順理成章地由當前談話主題切換至另一個剛想到或相關的新話題。",
              "sourceSpans": [
                {
                  "cueId": "c2",
                  "start": 25,
                  "end": 36
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "eedfb42a-614e-4bd8-9864-08eeba24cbb9:s0:p3",
              "utteranceIds": [
                "f2aae71e-0d0e-44ff-a79e-ae7fec517b4b"
              ],
              "category": "usage",
              "presentation": "core",
              "title": "簡短回答尚未完成：Non ancora",
              "sourceCueIds": [
                "c3"
              ],
              "contextCueIds": [
                "c2"
              ],
              "explanation": "Non ancora 意為「還沒」，在日常對話中常用於直接回應以「hai già ...?」（你已經……了嗎？）等詢問動作是否完成的疑問句，既簡潔又符合習慣。",
              "sourceSpans": [
                {
                  "cueId": "c3",
                  "start": 0,
                  "end": 10
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
